beholder eye dome~
the Eye in the Dome~
A vast floating eye turns slowly beneath the dome to fix its gaze on you.
~
A great round body that is mostly eye, crowned with writhing stalks that
each end in a smaller one. It came into Thalos with the darkness generations
ago and never left; the people of New Thalos still name it in their prayers,
as a thing to be spared from.
~
